{"type":"text","timestamp":1789175448506,"sessionID":"ses_f6cd72c6effeXppzTJW3q652tO","part":{"id":"prt_0932abc08001l6bxAwsNemAFN7","messageID":"msg_0932ab181001tC86J31DO5eoIR","sessionID":"ses_f6cd72c6effeXppzTJW3q652tO","type":"text","text":"Project detail never checks membership, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates invalidate only the detail cache. I’ll add the ownership check and organization-scoped list invalidation, preserve authorization before cache lookup, and add regression tests in a new file.\n","time":{"start":1789175446536,"end":1789175448504},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0e49f88bd530c117016aa4a6967fec87d1a7f6f8ccb4755190","phase":"commentary"}}}}
